# Slide 1: Title Slide
## Project Title: Cheff Claude
### Overview: A React application for managing ingredients and fetching recipes using AI.

# Slide 2: Introduction
- Cheff Claude is a cooking assistant application.
- Allows users to add ingredients and fetch recipes based on those ingredients.

# Slide 3: Technologies Used
- React: A JavaScript library for building user interfaces.
- Vite: A build tool that provides a fast development environment.

# Slide 4: Project Structure
- Overview of the file structure:
  - src/
    - components/
    - App.jsx
    - index.jsx
  - public/
  - README.md

# Slide 5: Header Component
- Displays the application logo and title.
- Simple functional component.

# Slide 6: Main Component
- Manages the list of ingredients.
- Allows users to add ingredients and fetch recipes.
- Integrates with the AI service to get recipes.

# Slide 7: Recipe Component
- Displays the fetched recipe using Markdown.
- Provides a user-friendly view of the recipe content.

# Slide 8: AI Integration
- Uses the `getRecipeFromMistral` function to fetch recipes based on user input.
- Integrates AI to provide personalized recipe suggestions.

# Slide 9: User Interaction
- Users can add ingredients through a form.
- Recipes are displayed based on the ingredients provided.

# Slide 10: Conclusion
- Cheff Claude is a functional cooking assistant.
- Future improvements could include more features and better AI integration.
